          "_name": "features7",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise4",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"features7\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Cards\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n        </select>\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"../_images/background5.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#efefef\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"media\">\n                    <div class=\"card-img pr-2\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbrib-paper-plane\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box media-body\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title py-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\">Machine Learning Paper for TES data published</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">(01/2026) Elmeri's paper on binary classification of background and signal events in our transition edge sensor is <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-025-33353-4\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">published in scientific reports</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"media\"> \n                    <div class=\"card-img pr-2\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbrib-idea\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box media-body\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title py-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\">&nbsp;IGMF constraints with GRB221009A accepted in PRD</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">(01/2026) We constrain the intergalactic magnetic field with Fermi-LAT observations of the brightest ever GRB221009A. Check out the paper <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.11128\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"media\">\n                    <div class=\"card-img pr-2\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbrib-magic-stick\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"media-body card-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title py-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\">First science results of ALPS II are on arXiv</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">(12/2025) The<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.14110\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"> first science results</a> of the ALPS II detector are finally on the arXiv together with<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.18684\" class=\"text-primary\"> an in-detail description</a> of the optics and analysis. What an achievement and congratulations to everyone involved.&nbsp;</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 3\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"media\">\n                    <div class=\"card-img pr-2\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbri-desktop mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box media-body\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title py-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\">\n                            Unlimited Sites\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                           Mobirise gives you the freedom to develop as many websites as you like given the fact that it is a desktop app.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "v9SWb9PS79",
          "_anchor": "features7-2d",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
