          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise4",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"mbr-section content4\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#efefef\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    Theses</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Bachelor, master, and PhD theses written in our group are collected here</h3>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center py-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-black-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tRDvjdpueG",
          "_anchor": "content4-1z",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".mbr-text, blockquote": {
              "color": "#767676"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content1",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise4",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"mbr-section article content1\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Width Content\" name=\"widthContent\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#efefef\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters> \n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"mbr-text col-12 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': widthContent == 1, 'col-md-8': widthContent == 2, 'col-md-10': widthContent == 3, 'col-md-12': widthContent == 4}\"><p><b><u>PhD Theses</u></b></p><p><b style>2025</b></p><p>Rahul Cecil: \"The Astrophysical Search For&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Axion Like Particle Signatures&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">In γ-ray Propagation\"</span></p><p><b><u>Master theses</u></b></p><p><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">2025</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Constant Peters: <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/MA_Peeters.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\">\"Detectability of Gravitational Waves&nbsp;</a></span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/MA_Peeters.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\">from Primordial Black Hole Mergers&nbsp;</a></span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/MA_Peeters.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\">with the ALPS II Experiment\"</a></span>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Katrine Kennedy: <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/MA_Kennedy.pdf.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">\"Do we need Axion-Like-Particles to explain the high photon energies from GRB221009A?\"</a></span><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Johanna Müller: <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/MSc_Thesis_Mueller_Johanna.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">\"Investigating the origin&nbsp;</a></span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/MSc_Thesis_Mueller_Johanna.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">of multi TeV emission of the&nbsp;</a></span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/MSc_Thesis_Mueller_Johanna.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">GRB 221009A\"</a></span></p><p><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">2024</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Lea Burmeister: <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/MA_Burmeister.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">\"Searching for electron-positron pair cascades from GRB221009A\"</a></span></p><p><b><u>Bachelor theses</u></b></p><p><b>2025</b></p><p>Joakim Rosenkilde: <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/BA_Rosenkilde.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\">\"Optimizing the alignment of a&nbsp;</a><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/BA_Rosenkilde.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\">cryogenic optical filter bench\"&nbsp;</a></span></p><p><b>2024</b></p><p>Friedrich Landvogt: <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/BA_Landgraf.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">\"The effect of the Milky Way magnetic field on photon-axion conversions\"</a></p><p><b>2023</b></p><p>Malte Thoms: <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/BA_Thoms.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">\"Studying black body radiation backgrounds for the ALPS II TES Detector\"</a></p><p>Till Moritz: <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/BA_Moritz.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">\"Combined Analysis of the 2019 gamma-ray flare from PG 1553+113 with Femi-LAT and H.E.S.S.\"</a></p><p>Emre Toka: <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/BA_Toka.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">\"Investigating machine learning algorithms for signal and background discrimination in the ALPS TES detector\"</a></p><p>Yosef Abed: <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/BA_Abed.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">\"Charakterisierung des Gammastrahlungs-Flares des Blazars PG 1553+113 im April 2019 mit H.E.S.S.\"</a></p><p><b>2022</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Jan Wisenmüller: <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axion-alp-dm/axion-alp-dm.github.io/main/Theses/BA_Wiesenmueller.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">\"Characterization of optical components to determine the efficiency of the ALPS II TES detector\"</a></span></p></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
